## Input

```mlk
// The project keyword written where a name belongs, all over a module: in the preamble, in
// the path of an expression, and in the path of a call. The items, the expression and the
// `in` around the mistakes are read whole.

module project.project.project

@extern
fun println-int(x: Int): Unit

fun main(): Unit =
    let x = project.project.abs(42) * 2 - 10 in
    println-int(x + 20)

